      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Partially replacing Mo with Nb will reduce the alloy's overall electronegativity difference.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing Nb and reducing Mo will diminish contrasting bonding effects associated with high Mo content.",
